--[[
	Anomaly Coop - the Bar arena and the totalizator in a session (gamedata\scripts\coop_arena.script).

	Stock knows one actor (xr_effects.bar_arena_teleport, bar_arena_teleport_2, bar_arena_weapon_slot,
	teleport_for_totaliz_out, dialogs_mlr.teleport_for_totaliz; the trigger bar_arena_triger.ltx and its
	sr_cutscene@fight_N): his whole inventory goes into the story box bar_arena_inventory_box, he gets the fight's kit; on the
	way out what he has goes into bar_arena_inventory_box_2 and the first box comes back to him.
	In a session that breaks three ways (one player loses his weapons, armour and helmet, the other drops out of sync and walks
	the map naked and unseen):
	  - the trigger is a world restrictor nobody walks into: its actor effects go to every player, and its cutscene (a section
	    scheme, run by every machine that takes the host's section) took everybody on the Bar into the arena;
	  - a client's own moves into and out of a story box are requests the host checks for reach (15 m) while the cutscene
	    carries him away, rate limited item by item; the host's own way back took the whole box, other players' gear with it;
	  - the arena zone counts a client's character (a stalker on the host) as an arena item: its purge took him out of the world.
	Here the arena is one player's fight:
	  - The taker: the player who talked to the arena manager (story id bar_arena_manager) last (the engine's talk locks,
	    coop.talk_recent), else the one nearest to him; picked by the authority of the Bar (the host, or the map server of the
	    Bar) when the fight is taken. Group entry, as at a transition (people walk up, and the one who decided to start holds
	    the use key to go with those near): with other players on the map the trigger waits in sr_idle@wait_N (its 1 s timer held, nobody's UI taken). Every player
	    on the map is told his part (arena.go "gather"; the board and the key are coop_hud_arena's): the starter (the taker; when
	    he left the map or is down, the standing player nearest to Arnie within GATHER_RADIUS) holds the use key at Arnie, and who
	    stands within GATHER_RADIUS of Arnie then fights, the starter first. No window, no vote, never by itself: who stepped away
	    before the key, or came after it, stays. Nobody else on the map: at
	    once, as stock. The gathering is the Bar's: off the Bar (a co-op group that walked to another map) or with Arnie not
	    here it rests, nobody is told anything, and it goes on back at Arnie. A trigger found waiting with no record of its fight
	    (a new map server of the Bar, an older save) is taken as at the dialog, and waits while nobody is on the map.
	    The trigger's actor effects (disable_ui, enable_ui) go to the fighters (coop_npc_logic
	    audience rule). Its cutscene plays on the fighters' machines alone, each put at a spot of his own; anywhere else the
	    section stands still, and on the authority it ends when theirs end (arena.cut), or after CUT_WAIT_MS. One who falls is out;
	    the fight goes on while a fighter is left.
	  - The arena zone is the pit's, by its name (ZONE): the Bar has two script_zones with [arena_zone] (all.spawn: bar_arena,
	    the pit; bar_old_arena, the old monster cage above it, spawned after it) and xr_zones binds both. Taking the last one (the
	    cage) would make a fighter in the pit "outside the arena" (his own gear back in the fight, the kit taken, no way out
	    after the win). A fighter whose cutscene ended (arena.cut) is in the arena's custody even with no zone
	    known here.
	  - The way out of a won fight is the commentator's line (bar_arena_comment_fight_1.ltx: its sound_end runs
	    bar_arena_teleport_2). One that never comes is taken by the authority of the Bar a fight's wait (10-37 s, the lengths of
	    the lines) after it saw bar_arena_fight_N_done, once, for the fighters alive or down (late_way_out); a line that ends late is
	    not the way out of a fight taken since.
	  - His gear: the authority moves it, and keeps a ledger per character (the ids; the ids of the kit his machine made; saved with
	    the host's world, and with split levels carried through the world server, the server's share "arena_ledger", coop_srv_levels_share):
	      in   his whole inventory into box 1;
	      out  into box 2 what the arena gave him: everything he holds in the arena or at the end of a bet; outside the pit
	           only the kit, by its ids (what he found outside stays his, also for a fighter never seen inside). The arena's
	           purge (not while another player's fight runs, nor for one never seen inside); the ids of his ledger from box 1
	           back to him. No box 1 here: the ledger waits. A row of an older save (the avatar id alone) is the character's
	           that holds the id when it is first looked at; an id with no player character then makes it an orphan for good.
	    Then his own machine runs the stock call for the rest (the kit, the screen, the way in or out), with both story boxes
	    hidden (get_story_object answers nil for them) and the purge left out: the boxes are the authority's. The way in waits
	    until the moved gear has left his machine (IN_WAIT_MS). Equipment wrappers run there as in single player and what
	    they make is the kit (arena.kit). Our wrapper must stay outermost so equipment changes still run on the fighter.
	  - A bet at the totalizator is the same: in from the dialog (the bettor asks, arena.bet; refused while his gear is in a box
	    already), out from the totalizator's restrictor, for every bettor of the ledger. Stock moves the bettor inside its box
	    branch: that move is made here.
	  - A fighter who dies in the arena loses what he holds there at once, where he fell (fall_tick: the kit, what the game
	    made of it, what he took from an opponent, the stash his death left in the pit): a death never takes the arena's
	    things out. His own gear comes back when he respawns (coop_respawned), or when he is back on the Bar after a rejoin
	    and no fight runs (actor_on_first_update): he asks (arena.out), the authority gives it back and answers with the way out.
	    An ask that never came (sent before his game was live, lost with a crash): the authority gives back by itself a ledger
	    older than HEAL_GRACE_MS whose player stands on the Bar with nothing of his running (his fight, a totalizator battle).
	    His flag (coop_arena_gear) is a per-player key: the host keeps it for his character, a client never saves.
	  - The arena zone never counts a player: xr_zones.arena_zone_binder:purge_items leaves players out.
	  - Arnie's prizes (dialogs_bar.new_arena_give_reward, and arena_give_reward of the monster fight) are the authority's: anybody
	    may collect one (it opens the next fight), the money goes to the fight's fighters (split by the setting
	    coop_share_rewards), the arena battle counts on each fighter's machine, and a fight that runs meanwhile keeps
	    bar_arena_fight and bar_arena_fight_begin (stock takes them off: in single player the prize always comes after the fight).
	    A player's kill is counted by his own machine, whose stock game_statistics.increment_reputation spares him while
	    bar_arena_fight is on: a prize collected during his fight would cost him the reputation. With coop_debug on, a reputation
	    change during a fight goes into the player's log with its source.
	  - Arnie's monster fight (the old arena: bar_arena_start, restrictors bar_arena_sr and bar_arena_spam; the player walks in,
	    no gear moves) speaks through effects the host runs: the introduction, "the fight begins", the countdown 10-90 s, "time
	    is up", "victory", "you are afraid", "dead". Their lines (news_manager.send_tip) go to its fighter alone (arena.go "tip"),
	    the infos they give stay the world's. The fighter: of a running fight (bar_arena_fight_N) its fighter; else the one
	    picked when he walks into bar_arena_waiter (among those who walked in), kept until "victory", "dead" or "you are afraid".
	    Its death: in a session nobody dies for the engine and bar_arena_sr's {=actor_dead} read the host; asked by bar_arena_sr it
	    now means "no player alive or down in its zone for PIT_GONE_MS" (the fighter seen there is the fight's, also after a load,
	    and kept in the host's save), and the branch's dead end sr_idle@nil is put back to the arena's start (pit_reset_tick).
	Single player and an exe without co-op: stock, untouched.

	Events (coop_npc_players):
	  arena.go   authority -> player   { f = "in" | "out" | "slot" | "bet_in" | "bet_out" | "none" | "tip" | "stat", a = argument }
	             (tip: a = the line's string id; to, s, st, sid = the rest of news_manager.send_tip)
	  arena.bet  bettor -> authority   { }
	  arena.out  player -> authority   { }  his gear back
	  arena.cut  fighter -> authority  { }  his cutscene ended
	  arena.kit  player -> authority   { i = "id,id,..." }  what his stock call made (the kit)
	  arena.prize player -> authority  { k = "new" | "old" }  he collects a prize at Arnie
	  arena.start player -> authority  { }  the starter held the use key at Arnie (coop_hud_arena)
	  arena.go "gather": a = "lead" | "lead_far" | "with" | "invite" | "off" (n = the fight, w / s = the starter's nick / peer,
	           c / t = near Arnie / on the map, r / o = the peers near / away, p = the key passed to him);
	           "ui_off": stock disable_ui on his machine (the group's start); "in": k = his spot in the pit
	Status: coop_status line "arena".
--]]

local tostring, tonumber, type, pairs, ipairs, pcall, next = tostring, tonumber, type, pairs, ipairs, pcall, next

local TAG = "arena"
local ARENA_LEVEL = "l05_bar"
local AVATAR_SECTION = "coop_player_avatar"
local BOX_IN, BOX_OUT = "bar_arena_inventory_box", "bar_arena_inventory_box_2"
local MANAGER = "bar_arena_manager"
-- m around Arnie, straight, where the authority sees the players: who stands there when the starter's key is held goes in. All.spawn:
-- Arnie (149, 1, 72); the totalizator 4.2 m, t_walk_2 (out of the pit) 1.3 m, the old arena's door 8.5 m, the pit's t_way 22.5 m.
local GATHER_RADIUS = 10
local SPOT_STEP = 1.5 -- m between the fighters' spots in the pit (sideways from the cutscene's point)
local SPOT_TYPE = "secondary_task_location" -- the invitation's map spot on Arnie (stock map_spots.xml)
local TRIGGER = "bar_arena_triger"
local ZONE = "bar_arena"
local FIGHTS = 8
local MAX_KIT_IDS = 256 -- one loadout report, including items made by stock-call wrappers
local CUT_WAIT_MS = 30000
local IN_WAIT_MS = 3000
local HEAL_GRACE_MS = 15000 -- a ledger older than this whose player stands here with nothing of his running: given back
local TICK_MS = 1000
local TALK_WINDOWS = { 2000, 5000, 15000, 60000 } -- coop.talk_recent takes up to 60 s
-- dialogs_mlr.teleport_for_totaliz moves the bettor inside its box branch. With the box hidden, this script moves the bettor.
local BET_POS = { 139.61517333984, -13.390427589417, 100.86038208008 }
local BET_LV, BET_GV = 37564, 1710

local P -- coop_npc_players

local ledger = {} -- authority: character key -> { id = avatar id, character = key, kind, items, kit, at, ... }
local cleared = {} -- returns made before the first down share: skip its stale rows and send their removal even with no rows left
local fight = nil -- authority: { id = the starter's avatar id (the taker, or who took the key over), n = the fight, ids = the
--   fighters (the starter first; nil while held), hold = the group gathers at Arnie, board = { [id] = what he was told last },
--   passed = the key went to another player, cuts = { [id] = his cutscene ended } }
local pit = nil -- authority: { id = the fighter's avatar id } of Arnie's monster fight (the old arena: its lines are his)
local cut_done = false -- authority: the fighter's cutscene ended
local fighters_of = {} -- authority: fight n -> { avatar id, ... } of its fighters (its prize is theirs)
local pit_won = nil -- authority: the avatar id of the fighter of the last won monster fight (its bet prize is his)
local paying = false -- authority: a prize's stock call runs (wrappers under ours let it through)
local mine = false -- this player: false | "fight" | "bet" - his gear waits in the box
local fighting = false -- this player fights the running fight: its cutscene plays here
local spot_k = 0 -- this player: his place among the fighters (0: the cutscene's point, then sideways)
local invite_spot = nil -- this player: the id of Arnie with the invitation's map spot
local board = nil -- this player: what the authority told him of the gathering at Arnie (coop_hud_arena shows it)
local passing = false -- the stock chain runs for this machine's own player: our wrappers let it through
local arena_zone = nil -- the binder of the arena zone here (xr_zones.arena_zone_binder): its object answers inside()
local got_down = false -- the map server of the Bar: the world server's copy of the ledger came (split levels)
local world_copy = nil -- the world server: the ledger of the Bar's map server, kept in its save (split levels)
local OURS = {} -- our wrapper functions
local stats = { stowed = 0, returned = 0, to_box2 = 0, missing = 0, players_kept = 0, still_cuts = 0, rewrapped = 0, errors = 0,
	tips = 0, tip_wraps = 0, prizes = 0, prize_asks = 0, rep_lines = 0, fell = 0, zone = "-", other_zones = 0, starts = 0, refused = 0 }

local function report(what, err)
	stats.errors = stats.errors + 1
	P.report(TAG, what, err)
end

local function session() return P ~= nil and P.active() end
-- The process whose world holds the arena: the host, or the map server of the Bar (what a player asks goes to the one
-- that leads his level).
local function authority() return session() and (coop_mode.decides_world() or coop_mode.leads_here()) end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The fight and its fighter (authority)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local function fight_running()
	for n = 1, FIGHTS do
		if has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_" .. n) and not has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_" .. n .. "_done") then return n end
	end
	return nil
end

local function id_of(o)
	local ok, id = pcall(o.id, o)
	return ok and id or nil
end

local go -- to the player whose character is `id` (below)

local function own_id() return db.actor and id_of(db.actor) or nil end

local function obj_of(id)
	if id == nil then return nil end
	if id == own_id() then return db.actor end
	return level.object_by_id(id)
end

local function manager()
	local id = get_story_object_id and get_story_object_id(MANAGER)
	return id and level.object_by_id(id) or nil
end

-- The player who talked to the arena manager last; with no talk to go by (an exe without it, two at once), the nearest.
-- `among` ({ [id] = true }, optional): only these players, when any of them is here.
local function pick(near, among)
	local list = P.everyone()
	if among then
		local only = {}
		for _, o in ipairs(list) do
			if among[id_of(o)] then only[#only + 1] = o end
		end
		if #only > 0 then list = only end
	end
	if #list == 0 then return nil end
	local man = manager()
	local api = rawget(_G, "coop")
	local recent = man and api and api.talk_recent
	if recent then
		local man_id = id_of(man)
		for _, ms in ipairs(TALK_WINDOWS) do
			local found, n = nil, 0
			for _, o in ipairs(list) do
				local peer = P.peer_of(o)
				local ok, r = pcall(recent, peer, man_id, ms)
				if peer ~= nil and ok and r == true then found, n = o, n + 1 end
			end
			if n == 1 then return found end
			if n > 1 then break end
		end
	end
	local pos = man and man:position() or (near and near:position())
	if not pos then return list[1] end
	local best, bd = nil, math.huge
	for _, o in ipairs(list) do
		local d = o:position():distance_to_sqr(pos)
		if d < bd then best, bd = o, d end
	end
	return best
end

-- The running fight's record; a fight that starts gets its fighter now.
-- The running fight's fighters, the taker first ({ taker } while the group gathers).
local function fighters()
	if not fight then return {} end
	return fight.ids or { fight.id }
end

local function is_fighter(id)
	if id == nil then return false end
	for _, f in ipairs(fighters()) do
		if f == id then return true end
	end
	return false
end

-- With an id, the authority answers for a recipient. The recipient can also check its own arena state when it accepts.
function blocks_trip(id)
	if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then return false end
	if id ~= nil then return is_fighter(id) end
	return mine == "fight" or (coop_mode.actor_is_player() and is_fighter(own_id()))
end

-- The players on this map (ids): `near` those on their feet within GATHER_RADIUS of Arnie (the starter first when he is one of
-- them), `all` everybody; `dist` = { [id] = m to Arnie } of those near.
local function gathered(starter)
	local man = manager()
	local mp = man and man:position()
	local near, all, dist = {}, {}, {}
	for _, o in ipairs(P.everyone()) do
		local id = id_of(o)
		if id ~= nil then
			all[#all + 1] = id
			local d = mp and o:position():distance_to(mp)
			if d and d <= GATHER_RADIUS and P.standing(id) then
				dist[id] = d
				if id == starter then table.insert(near, 1, id) else near[#near + 1] = id end
			end
		end
	end
	return near, all, dist
end

local gather_tick -- the group gathers (below)

-- `lost`: the record of a fight taken earlier is gone (who took it is not known here): never at once, by a key at Arnie.
local function current(near, lost)
	local n = fight_running()
	if n and not (fight and fight.n == n) then
		local o = pick(near)
		if not o then return fight end
		fight = { id = id_of(o), n = n }
		cut_done = false
		local _, all = gathered(fight.id)
		if #all <= 1 and not lost then
			fight.ids = { fight.id } -- nobody else on the map: at once, as stock
		else
			fight.hold, fight.board = true, {}
		end
		fighters_of[n] = fight.ids or { fight.id }
		P.log(TAG, "fight %d: taken by %s (peer %s), %s", n, tostring(o:name()), tostring(P.peer_of(o)),
			fight.hold and string.format("the group gathers: %d player(s) on the map, it starts by its starter's key at Arnie", #all)
				or "nobody else on the map: it starts")
		if fight.hold then gather_tick() end
	end
	return fight
end

function fight_over()
	if fight and fight.board then
		for id in pairs(fight.board) do go(id, "gather", "off") end
	end
	fight, cut_done = nil, false
end

-- A fight with no fighter left in it is off (coop_encounters' rule, run where the Bar is led): its opponents and the arena's
-- items go, the fight's record goes, each fighter's gear waits for him.
function clear()
	for _, id in pairs(db.OnlineStalkers or {}) do
		local o = level.object_by_id(id)
		if o and o:section():find("bar_arena_stalker", 1, true) == 1 then safe_release_manager.release({ id = id }) end
	end
	local xz = coop_util.module("xr_zones")
	if xz and xz.purge_arena_items then xz.purge_arena_items(ZONE) end
	fight_over()
end

-- The trigger waiting for the end of a fight (sr_idle@wait_finish) goes back to its start: the fight can be asked for again.
function to_start()
	for _, zone in pairs(db.zone_by_name or {}) do
		local st = db.storage[zone:id()]
		if st and st.ini and st.active_section == "sr_idle@wait_finish" and st.ini:section_exist("sr_cutscene@fight_1") then
			xr_logic.switch_to_section(zone, st.ini, "sr_idle@idle")
			return
		end
	end
end

local function is_trigger(obj)
	if not obj then return false end
	local ok, name = pcall(obj.name, obj)
	if ok and name == TRIGGER then return true end
	local id = id_of(obj)
	local st = id and db.storage[id]
	if not (st and st.ini) then return false end
	local okx, has = pcall(st.ini.section_exist, st.ini, "sr_cutscene@fight_1")
	return okx and has == true
end

-- coop_npc_logic: the trigger's actor effects are the fighter's.
local function audience_rule(npc)
	if not (session() and authority() and is_trigger(npc)) then return nil end
	local f = current(npc)
	if not f then return nil end
	local set = {}
	if f.hold then return set end -- the group gathers: nobody's UI goes (the taker presses and walks)
	for _, id in ipairs(fighters()) do set[id] = true end
	return set
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The gear (authority)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local function parent_id(item)
	local ok, p = pcall(item.parent, item)
	return ok and p and id_of(p) or nil
end

-- A script transfer can be refused while the online inventory still shows its old holder.
local function item_place(id, item)
	local se = alife_object(id)
	if se and type(se.parent_id) == "number" then return se.parent_id, se end
	return item and parent_id(item), se
end

local function items_of(o)
	local list = {}
	o:inventory_for_each(function(item) list[#list + 1] = item end)
	return list
end

local function avatar_key(obj)
	local ini = obj and obj:spawn_ini()
	if ini and ini:section_exist("coop") and ini:line_exist("coop", "key") then
		local key = ini:r_string("coop", "key")
		if type(key) == "string" and key ~= "" then return key end
	end
end

local function character_key(id)
	if id == nil then return nil end
	if id == 0 then return coop_mode.actor_is_player() and "actor" or nil end
	-- The live object's ini has the join key even if ALife cached its ini before the engine set custom data.
	local o = obj_of(id)
	if o and o:section() ~= AVATAR_SECTION then return nil end
	local key = avatar_key(o) or avatar_key(alife_object(id))
	return key and (tostring(id) .. ":" .. key) or nil
end

local function row_key(r)
	if type(r) == "table" and type(r.id) == "number" and type(r.items) == "table" then
		return type(r.character) == "string" and r.character or ("legacy:" .. r.id)
	end
end

local function clear_record(key)
	ledger[key] = nil
	if not got_down and not coop_mode.decides_world() then cleared[key] = true end
end

-- A row of a save made before the ledger was keyed by character names only the avatar id ("legacy:<id>"). The save that holds it
-- holds that id's character too, so the row is the character's under that id when it is first looked at (his gear waits in
-- box 1). An id that names no player character then (a retirement released it) makes the row an orphan for good: a later
-- character under that id never gets it. A character whose join key cannot be read yet is looked at again.
local function adopt_legacy(id, key)
	local lk = "legacy:" .. tostring(id)
	local old = ledger[lk]
	if not old or old.orphan then return nil end
	if not key then
		local se = id ~= 0 and alife_object(id)
		if not (se and se:section_name() == AVATAR_SECTION) then
			old.orphan = true
			P.log(TAG, "! a ledger row of an older save names character %s, who is not in the world: it stays in the save", tostring(id))
		end
		return nil
	end
	if ledger[key] then return nil end
	clear_record(lk)
	old.character = key
	ledger[key] = old
	P.log(TAG, "a ledger row of an older save is character %s's: %d thing(s) of his wait in %s", tostring(id), #old.items, BOX_IN)
	return old
end

local function record_of(id)
	if id == nil then return nil, nil end
	local key = character_key(id)
	local rec = key and ledger[key]
	if not rec then rec = adopt_legacy(id, key) end
	return rec, key
end

-- The rows as a list: a loop over it may look a row up (record_of adopts an older save's row under another key).
local function rows()
	local list = {}
	for _, rec in pairs(ledger) do list[#list + 1] = rec end
	return list
end

-- Once after rows came in (a load, the world's copy): every older save's row is decided while the world it came with is here.
local legacy_due = false
local function legacy_tick()
	if not legacy_due then return end
	legacy_due = false
	for _, rec in ipairs(rows()) do
		if not rec.character and not rec.orphan then
			record_of(rec.id)
			-- his key is not readable yet, or a newer row of his is open: looked at again
			if not rec.character and not rec.orphan then legacy_due = true end
		end
	end
end

-- His whole inventory into box 1, the ids into his ledger. -> the ids moved now ("1,2,3"), nil: there is no box here, he
-- keeps his gear.
local function stow(o, kind)
	local box = get_story_object(BOX_IN)
	if not box then
		P.log(TAG, "! %s is not here: %s keeps his gear", BOX_IN, tostring(o:name()))
		return nil
	end
	local id = id_of(o)
	local rec, key = record_of(id)
	if not key then
		P.log(TAG, "! no character key for %s: his gear stays with him", tostring(id))
		return nil
	end
	rec = rec or { id = id, character = key, items = {}, kit = {} }
	rec.kind, rec.at = kind, time_global()
	local moved = {}
	for _, item in ipairs(items_of(o)) do
		o:transfer_item(item, box)
		moved[#moved + 1] = id_of(item)
		rec.items[#rec.items + 1] = moved[#moved]
		stats.stowed = stats.stowed + 1
	end
	ledger[key], cleared[key] = rec, nil
	return table.concat(moved, ",")
end

-- The arena's leftovers go, unless another player's fight runs there now (its opponents are in the zone too).
local function purge(for_id)
	if fight and not is_fighter(for_id) and fight_running() then return end
	local xz = coop_util.module("xr_zones")
	if xz and xz.purge_arena_items then
		local ok, err = pcall(xz.purge_arena_items, ZONE)
		if not ok then report("purge", err) end
	end
end

-- Stands in the arena zone; nil: the zone is not known here.
local function in_arena(o)
	local z = arena_zone and arena_zone.object
	if not z then return nil end
	local ok, r = pcall(z.inside, z, o:position())
	return ok and r == true
end

-- Return the gear and say whether this character needs the arena exit. False: he or box 1 is unavailable. The kit his machine
-- reported goes into box 2 by its ids wherever he stands (it is the arena's, also for one who never reached the pit).
local function give_back(id, bet_end)
	local o = obj_of(id)
	if not o then return false end
	local rec, key = record_of(id)
	if not rec then return true, in_arena(o) end
	local box = get_story_object(BOX_IN)
	if not box then return false end -- box 1 is not online here: his ledger waits
	local all = bet_end or in_arena(o)
	local custody = all or rec.kind == "bet" or rec.inside or rec.loose or rec.fell or rec.cut
	local kit = {}
	for _, k in ipairs(rec.kit or {}) do kit[k] = true end
	local box2 = get_story_object(BOX_OUT)
	local taken, back = 0, 0
	if box2 then
		local box2_id = id_of(box2)
		for _, item in ipairs(items_of(o)) do
			local iid = id_of(item)
			if all or kit[iid] then
				o:transfer_item(item, box2)
				local at, se = item_place(iid, item)
				if at == box2_id then
					stats.to_box2 = stats.to_box2 + 1
					taken = taken + 1
				else
					P.log(TAG, "item %s of %s (section %s, parent %s) is not in %s: not moved",
						tostring(iid), tostring(o:name()), tostring(se and se:section_name() or item:section()), tostring(at), BOX_OUT)
				end
			end
		end
	end
	if custody then purge(id) end
	local box_id = id_of(box)
	for _, iid in ipairs(rec.items) do
		local item = level.object_by_id(iid)
		local at, se = item_place(iid, item)
		if item and box_id and at == box_id then
			box:transfer_item(item, o)
			at, se = item_place(iid, item)
			if at == id then
				stats.returned = stats.returned + 1
				back = back + 1
			end
		end
		if at ~= id then
			stats.missing = stats.missing + 1
			local section = se and se:section_name() or item and item:section()
			P.log(TAG, "%sitem %s of %s (section %s, parent %s) is not in %s: not given back",
				P.is_player_id(at) and "" or "! ", tostring(iid), tostring(o:name()), tostring(section), tostring(at), BOX_IN)
		end
	end
	-- one line a give back: what stayed with a player after the arena is read from the log
	P.log(TAG, "%s: %d of his own given back, %d of the arena's into %s (%s)%s", tostring(o:name()), back, taken, BOX_OUT,
		all and "everything he held" or (custody and "the kit by its ids" or "never entered the pit: the kit by its ids"),
		box2 and "" or ": ! that box is not here, nothing was taken")
	clear_record(key)
	return true, custody
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The player's own machine
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local function set_mine(v)
	mine = v
	local em = coop_util.module("coop_economy_mdata")
	if em and em.send_player_keys then em.send_player_keys() end
end

-- The current chain (our wrapper outermost) for this machine's own player: both story boxes hidden, the purge left out.
-- -> ok, the ids of what it made (the kit, a mod's magazines, the binoculars of a bet)
local function run_local(tbl, key, ...)
	local f = tbl and tbl[key]
	if type(f) ~= "function" then return false, {} end
	local made, seen = {}, {}
	local function catch(g)
		if type(g) ~= "function" then return g end
		return function(...)
			local se = g(...)
			local ok, id = pcall(function() return se and se.id end)
			if ok and type(id) == "number" and not seen[id] then
				seen[id] = true
				made[#made + 1] = P.to_host(id)
			end
			return se
		end
	end
	local ac, aci = _G.alife_create, _G.alife_create_item
	local w_ac, w_aci = catch(ac), catch(aci)
	_G.alife_create, _G.alife_create_item = w_ac, w_aci
	local gso = _G.get_story_object
	local function hidden(sid, ...)
		if sid == BOX_IN or sid == BOX_OUT then return nil end
		if type(gso) == "function" then return gso(sid, ...) end
		return nil
	end
	local xz = coop_util.module("xr_zones")
	local purge_f = xz and xz.purge_arena_items
	_G.get_story_object = hidden
	if purge_f then xz.purge_arena_items = function() end end
	passing = true
	local ok, err = pcall(f, ...)
	passing = false
	if _G.get_story_object == hidden then _G.get_story_object = gso end
	if _G.alife_create == w_ac then _G.alife_create = ac end
	if _G.alife_create_item == w_aci then _G.alife_create_item = aci end
	if purge_f and xz.purge_arena_items ~= purge_f then xz.purge_arena_items = purge_f end
	if not ok then report("stock " .. key, err) end
	return ok, made
end

-- The authority learns what the arena gave this player (the kit goes back to box 2 even when he comes out elsewhere).
local add_kit -- defined with the authority's functions below

local function report_kit(made)
	if #made == 0 or not coop_mode.actor_is_player() then return end
	if authority() then return add_kit(own_id(), made) end
	P.send("arena.kit", { i = table.concat(made, ",") }, 0)
end

local function bet_teleport()
	if not db.actor or level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then return end
	level.add_pp_effector("fade_in.ppe", 200, false)
	db.actor:set_actor_position(vector():set(BET_POS[1], BET_POS[2], BET_POS[3]), BET_LV, BET_GV)
end

-- The way in waits until the gear the authority moved has left this machine's inventory (its moves come by another road than
-- arena.go). Delayed equipment updates, such as equipping an outfit or charging an exoskeleton, must see only the kit.
local waiting_in = nil -- { ids = { id, ... }, since = time }

local function still_mine(ids)
	local me = own_id()
	for _, id in ipairs(ids) do
		local item = level.object_by_id(P.to_local(id))
		if item and parent_id(item) == me then return true end
	end
	return false
end

local function way_in()
	waiting_in = nil
	local _, made = run_local(coop_util.module("xr_effects"), "bar_arena_teleport", db.actor, nil)
	report_kit(made)
end

local function wait_tick()
	if not waiting_in then return end
	if not still_mine(waiting_in.ids) then return way_in() end
	if time_global() - waiting_in.since >= IN_WAIT_MS then
		P.log(TAG, "! the way in after %d ms: %d moved item(s) still here", IN_WAIT_MS, #waiting_in.ids)
		way_in()
	end
end

local function id_list(s)
	local ids = {}
	for v in tostring(s or ""):gmatch("%d+") do ids[#ids + 1] = tonumber(v) end
	return ids
end

local PLAY = {
	["in"] = function(a, t)
		fighting = true
		spot_k = tonumber(t and t.k) or 0
		set_mine("fight")
		waiting_in = { ids = id_list(a), since = time_global() }
		wait_tick()
	end,
	out = function()
		fighting, waiting_in, spot_k = false, nil, 0
		set_mine(false)
		-- the way out reads the arena's paths: on another map he only has his gear back
		if level.name() == ARENA_LEVEL then run_local(coop_util.module("xr_effects"), "bar_arena_teleport_2", db.actor, nil) end
	end,
	slot = function(a) run_local(coop_util.module("xr_effects"), "bar_arena_weapon_slot", db.actor, nil, { a }) end,
	bet_in = function(a)
		set_mine("bet")
		local _, made = run_local(coop_util.module("dialogs_mlr"), "teleport_for_totaliz", db.actor, nil)
		report_kit(made)
		if tostring(a) ~= "0" then bet_teleport() end
	end,
	bet_out = function()
		set_mine(false)
		if level.name() == ARENA_LEVEL then run_local(coop_util.module("xr_effects"), "teleport_for_totaliz_out", db.actor, nil) end
	end,
	none = function()
		fighting, waiting_in, spot_k = false, nil, 0
		set_mine(false)
	end,
	-- a line of the monster fight (a = its string id): on this screen, with the stock sender (sound, icon, PDA)
	tip = function(a, t)
		if type(a) ~= "string" or a:sub(1, 10) ~= "bar_arena_" then return end
		local nm = coop_util.module("news_manager")
		local send = nm and coop_mods_core.fn(nm, "send_tip")
		if not send then return end
		t = t or {}
		send(db.actor, a, tonumber(t.to), type(t.s) == "string" and t.s or nil, tonumber(t.st),
			type(t.sid) == "string" and t.sid or nil)
	end,
	-- a won fight's battle counts here (stock: game_statistics.increment_statistic in the prize's dialog)
	stat = function(a)
		if a ~= "arena_battles" then return end
		local gs = coop_util.module("game_statistics")
		local f = gs and coop_mods_core.fn(gs, "increment_statistic")
		if f then f(a) end
	end,
}

-- `t`: the whole message (what a play needs besides `a`).
local function play(what, a, t)
	local f = PLAY[what]
	if not (f and db.actor) then return end
	local ok, err = pcall(f, a, t)
	if not ok then report("play " .. tostring(what), err) end
end

-- To the player whose character is `id` here: his own machine plays it. `more`: fields besides f and a.
go = function(id, what, a, more)
	if id == own_id() and coop_mode.actor_is_player() then return play(what, a, more) end
	local peer = P.peer_of(id)
	if peer == nil then
		P.log(TAG, "! %s for character %s: he is not in the session", what, tostring(id))
		return
	end
	local t = { f = what, a = a }
	for k, v in pairs(more or {}) do t[k] = v end
	P.send("arena.go", t, peer)
end

-- The authority: this player's gear back, and his way out (after a respawn, a rejoin, a lost answer: not the fight's end).
-- While the group gathers nobody fights yet: the record stays and the trigger stays held (patch_idle). Ending it would let the trigger's
-- timer go, and route_in would take the player picked anew alone, without his key (the starter's character left the world,
-- nobody stood at Arnie). The key goes to who stands at Arnie (pass_key), else it waits.
local function remove_fighter(id)
	if fight and fight.hold then
		if id == fight.id then
			P.log(TAG, "fight %d: its starter %s is out while the group gathers: it waits for a key at Arnie", fight.n, tostring(id))
		end
		return
	end
	if fight and is_fighter(id) then
		local left = {}
		for _, f in ipairs(fighters()) do if f ~= id then left[#left + 1] = f end end
		if #left == 0 then
			fight_over()
		else
			fight.ids, fight.id = left, left[1] -- the others fight on
			P.log(TAG, "fight %d: character %s is out, %d fighter(s) left", fight.n, tostring(id), #left)
		end
	end
end

local function out_of(id)
	local rec = record_of(id)
	remove_fighter(id)
	if not rec then return go(id, "none") end
	local what = rec.kind == "bet" and "bet_out" or "out"
	local ok, exit = give_back(id)
	if ok then go(id, exit and what or "none") end
end

-- His cutscene ended: it put him into the pit. The arena's custody (the way out, everything he holds there is the arena's) even
-- with no zone known here.
local function cut_seen(id)
	local rec = record_of(id)
	if rec and rec.kind == "fight" and not rec.cut then
		rec.cut = true
		P.log(TAG, "character %s: his cutscene put him into the pit", tostring(id))
	end
end

add_kit = function(id, made)
	local rec = record_of(id)
	if not (rec and type(made) == "table") then return end
	rec.kit = rec.kit or {}
	for _, k in ipairs(made) do rec.kit[#rec.kit + 1] = k end
	P.log(TAG, "the arena's kit of character %s: %d thing(s) told, %d known", tostring(id), #made, #rec.kit)
end

-- The authority, every tick: a ledger whose player stands here and has nothing of his running (his fight, a totalizator
-- battle) is given back even when his own ask never came (sent before his game was live, lost with a crash).
local function heal_tick(now)
	if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then return end
	for _, rec in pairs(ledger) do
		local id = rec.id
		local o = obj_of(id)
		if o and rec.character and now - rec.at >= HEAL_GRACE_MS and P.standing(id) and character_key(id) == rec.character then
			-- A fighter stranded outside before entering can recover his gear even while the round goes on; one whose cutscene
			-- ended (it put him into the pit) is in the fight.
			local busy = (rec.kind == "fight" and is_fighter(id) and (rec.inside or rec.cut or in_arena(o) ~= false))
				or (rec.kind == "bet" and has_alife_info("begin_the_battle"))
			if not busy then
				P.log(TAG, "the gear of character %s waited: given back", tostring(id))
				return out_of(id) -- one a tick: out_of changes the ledger
			end
		end
	end
end

-- This player: his gear waits in the box and no fight holds him.
local function ask_out()
	if not (mine and session() and db.actor and level.name() == ARENA_LEVEL and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) then return end
	if authority() then return out_of(own_id()) end
	P.send("arena.out", {}, 0)
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The stock functions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The trigger's way in (sr_idle@wait_N): the authority.
local function route_in(_, npc)
	if not authority() then return end
	local f = current(npc)
	if f and f.hold then -- the trigger went on by another road: the taker alone
		gather_tick(true)
	end
	local any = false
	for k, id in ipairs(fighters()) do
		local o = obj_of(id)
		if o then
			any = true
			go(id, "in", stow(o, "fight") or "", { k = k - 1 })
		end
	end
	if not any then P.log(TAG, "! fight %s starts with no fighter here", tostring(fight_running())) end
end

-- The trigger's weapon slot (sr_idle@fight): the fighter's.
local function route_slot(_, _, p)
	if not (authority() and fight) then return end
	for _, id in ipairs(fighters()) do go(id, "slot", type(p) == "table" and p[1] or nil) end
end

-- The commentator's way out (a won fight): the fighter's. With no record of the fight (it was lost: a world whose record did not
-- come back), every fighter of the ledger who is here. Its line is a won fight's (it waits for bar_arena_fight_N_done): a record of
-- a fight not over is another one's, taken since (a line that ended late, after its way out came without it: late_way_out).
local function route_out()
	if not authority() then return end
	if fight and type(fight.n) == "number" and not has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_" .. fight.n .. "_done") then
		P.log(TAG, "! the commentator's way out while fight %d is not over: another fight's record, nothing moves", fight.n)
		return
	end
	local ids = {}
	if fight then
		ids = fighters()
	else
		for _, rec in ipairs(rows()) do
			if rec.kind == "fight" and record_of(rec.id) == rec then ids[#ids + 1] = rec.id end
		end
	end
	fight_over()
	for _, id in ipairs(ids) do
		local ok, exit = give_back(id)
		if ok then go(id, exit and "out" or "none") end
	end
end

-- A bet takes the gear of a player whose gear is in no box already and who fights no fight.
local function bet_of(id, o)
	if record_of(id) or is_fighter(id) then
		P.log(TAG, "! a bet of character %s refused: his gear is in the box already", tostring(id))
		return
	end
	go(id, "bet_in", stow(o, "bet") and 1 or 0)
end

-- The bet (a dialog action on the bettor's machine).
local function route_bet()
	if P.is_client() then
		P.send("arena.bet", {}, 0)
		return
	end
	local id = own_id()
	if id ~= nil then bet_of(id, db.actor) end
end

-- The totalizator's end (its restrictor): every bettor who is here.
local function route_bet_out()
	if not authority() then return end
	local ids = {}
	for _, rec in ipairs(rows()) do
		if rec.kind == "bet" and obj_of(rec.id) and record_of(rec.id) == rec then ids[#ids + 1] = rec.id end
	end
	if #ids == 0 then purge() end -- stock: the arena's leftovers go
	for _, id in ipairs(ids) do
		if give_back(id, true) then go(id, "bet_out") end
	end
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Arnie's monster fight: its lines are the fighter's (authority)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The old arena (dialog bar_arena_manager_game gives bar_arena_start; restrictor bar_arena_sr lets the fighter in through the
-- zone bar_arena_waiter, bar_arena_spam counts the time) shows its lines with news_manager.send_tip from these effects
-- (xr_effects.script:5888-5975), run by the host's restrictors. The infos they give (bar_arena_actor_lose, _victory,
-- bar_arena_start_introduce) are the world's: the stock call runs here, only its lines go to the fighter (arena.go "tip").
-- The host's own fight shows them here; coop_core_world_news keeps "bar_arena_*" lines off the others (PERSONAL_IDS).
local TIPS = { "bar_arena_introduce", "bar_arena_fight_begin", "bar_arena_check_lose", "bar_arena_after_fight",
	"bar_arena_actor_afraid", "bar_arena_actor_dead" }
for n = 10, 90, 10 do TIPS[#TIPS + 1] = "bar_arena_fight_" .. n end
-- These end a fight: its fighter is forgotten after them.
local TIP_ENDS = { bar_arena_after_fight = true, bar_arena_actor_dead = true, bar_arena_actor_afraid = true }

local function plain(v)
	local tv = type(v)
	return (tv == "string" or tv == "number" or tv == "boolean") and v or nil
end

-- The players a restrictor's condlist is for (coop_npc_logic), nil: it names none.
local function logic_audience(npc)
	local L = coop_util.module("coop_npc_logic")
	local f = L and coop_mods_core.fn(L, "audience_of")
	if not (f and npc) then return nil end
	local ok, aud = pcall(f, npc)
	return ok and type(aud) == "table" and next(aud) ~= nil and aud or nil
end

-- The players standing in the monster fight's arena, nil: none, or its zone is not known here. Its zone is the restrictor
-- bar_arena_sr (all.spawn: the old arena, the cage, a box 17.3 x 12.2 x 20.9 at 157, 0, 95), not the pit's script zone (the
-- arena zone of the new arena, 20 m below); without the restrictor, the pit's.
local PIT_ZONE = "bar_arena_sr" -- the monster fight's restrictor (also its death, below)
local function in_arena_set()
	local sr = db.zone_by_name and db.zone_by_name[PIT_ZONE]
	local set = nil
	for _, o in ipairs(P.everyone()) do
		local inside
		if sr then
			local ok, r = pcall(sr.inside, sr, o:position())
			inside = ok and r == true
		else
			inside = in_arena(o)
		end
		if inside then
			set = set or {}
			set[id_of(o)] = true
		end
	end
	return set
end

-- Whose line it is: the fighter of a running fight (bar_arena_fight_N), else the monster fight's. That one is picked when he
-- walks in (bar_arena_introduce: among the players who walked in), else when a line finds none (a load in the middle: among the
-- players in the arena). "You are afraid" ends a fight nobody walked into: the one who talked to Arnie last.
local function tip_fighter(name, npc)
	if fight_running() then
		local f = current(npc)
		if f then return f.id end
	end
	if name == "bar_arena_introduce" or name == "bar_arena_actor_afraid" or not pit then
		local among = nil
		if name == "bar_arena_introduce" then
			among = logic_audience(npc)
		elseif name ~= "bar_arena_actor_afraid" then
			among = in_arena_set()
		end
		local o = pick(npc, among)
		pit = o and { id = id_of(o) } or nil
		if o then P.log(TAG, "monster fight: the fighter is %s (peer %s)", tostring(o:name()), tostring(P.peer_of(o))) end
	end
	return pit and pit.id or nil
end

-- The stock call with its arena lines going to the player whose character is `id` (his own machine shows them); any other
-- line goes on as it would.
local function lines_to(id, cur, ...)
	local nm = coop_util.module("news_manager")
	local send = nm and coop_mods_core.fn(nm, "send_tip")
	if not send then return cur(...) end
	local function catch(actor, news_id, timeout, sender, showtime, sender_id, ...)
		if type(news_id) ~= "string" or news_id:sub(1, 10) ~= "bar_arena_" then
			return send(actor, news_id, timeout, sender, showtime, sender_id, ...)
		end
		go(id, "tip", news_id, { to = plain(timeout), s = type(sender) == "string" and sender or nil, st = plain(showtime),
			sid = plain(sender_id) })
		stats.tips = stats.tips + 1
		return true
	end
	nm.send_tip = catch
	local ok, r = pcall(cur, ...)
	if nm.send_tip == catch then nm.send_tip = send end
	if not ok then error(r, 0) end
	return r
end

local function route_tip(name, cur, actor, npc, ...)
	if not authority() then return cur(actor, npc, ...) end
	local id = tip_fighter(name, npc)
	local r
	if id == nil or (id == own_id() and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) then
		r = cur(actor, npc, ...)
	else
		r = lines_to(id, cur, actor, npc, ...)
	end
	if name == "bar_arena_after_fight" and id ~= nil and has_alife_info("bar_arena_actor_victory") then pit_won = id end
	if TIP_ENDS[name] then pit = nil end
	return r
end

-- Our wrappers outermost, as ensure_outer does for the gear.
local function ensure_tips()
	local xe = coop_util.module("xr_effects")
	if not xe then return end
	for _, name in ipairs(TIPS) do
		local cur = coop_mods_core.fn(xe, name)
		if cur and not OURS[cur] then
			local w = function(...)
				if passing or not session() then return cur(...) end
				return route_tip(name, cur, ...)
			end
			OURS[w] = true
			xe[name] = w
			stats.tip_wraps = stats.tip_wraps + 1
		end
	end
end

local ROUTES = {
	{ "xr_effects", "bar_arena_teleport", route_in },
	{ "xr_effects", "bar_arena_teleport_2", route_out },
	{ "xr_effects", "bar_arena_weapon_slot", route_slot },
	{ "xr_effects", "teleport_for_totaliz_out", route_bet_out },
	{ "dialogs_mlr", "teleport_for_totaliz", route_bet },
}

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Arnie's monster fight: its fighter's death (authority)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- bar_arena_sr in sr_idle@fight: on_info2 = {=actor_dead} sr_idle@nil %=bar_arena_actor_dead +bar_arena_actor_dead
-- +bar_arena_start_introduce%. xr_conditions.actor_dead reads db.actor, the host's own character, and in a session nobody dies
-- for the engine (a fallen player stays alive at 1 % health, coop_survival): no fighter's death ever ended the fight, and the
-- branch would end in sr_idle@nil for good (single player reloads after a death). Asked by bar_arena_sr in a session: dead =
-- no player alive or down has stood in the zone bar_arena_sr (where the fight starts, on_actor_in_zone) for PIT_GONE_MS: a
-- death, leaving the session, a respawn elsewhere (a teleport or a load is shorter). The host falling anywhere else is nobody's
-- business. The player seen there is the fight's (its lines are his, after a load too). After the branch the arena is back at
-- its start: the monster released, bar_old_arena_reset given and the fight's infos taken off (PIT_INFOS), bar_arena_sr at
-- sr_idle@idle and bar_arena_spam's logic at sr_idle@introduce (it waits in sr_idle@notiming for a monster's death that will
-- not come). A world saved with the arena stuck that way (before this) is put back the same way.
local PIT_GONE_MS = 5000
local PIT_MONSTERS = { "pseudodog", "snork", "bloodsucker", "burer", "savage" }
-- The infos of a fight, as info_portions.script's bar_old_arena_reset lists them (dialogs_bar.arena_give_reward takes them off
-- one by one too: "doesn't seem to be working"), with bar_arena_4000_r (a bet stock never takes back) and bar_arena_state_1.
local PIT_INFOS = { "bar_arena_start", "bar_arena_1000_r", "bar_arena_2000_r", "bar_arena_3000_r", "bar_arena_4000_r",
	"bar_arena_5000_r", "bar_arena_20_p", "bar_arena_50_p", "bar_arena_100_p", "bar_arena_start_introduce",
	"bar_arena_spawn_monstr", "bar_arena_monstr_ready", "bar_arena_monstr_dead", "bar_arena_actor_victory", "bar_arena_actor_lose",
	"bar_arena_actor_afraid", "bar_arena_actor_dead", "bar_arena_state_1" }
for n = 10, 90, 10 do PIT_INFOS[#PIT_INFOS + 1] = "bar_arena_fight_" .. n end
for _, m in ipairs(PIT_MONSTERS) do PIT_INFOS[#PIT_INFOS + 1] = "bar_arena_" .. m .. "_choosen" end
-- when a fighter was last seen in the zone; the section's activation it counts for; true: count from the next ask (a load, a reset)
local pit_seen, pit_act, pit_fresh = 0, nil, true

local function has_section(obj, section)
	local id = obj and id_of(obj)
	local st = id and db.storage[id]
	if not (st and st.ini) then return false end
	local ok, has = pcall(st.ini.section_exist, st.ini, section)
	return ok and has == true
end

local function is_pit_logic(npc)
	if not npc then return false end
	local ok, name = pcall(npc.name, npc)
	return (ok and name == PIT_ZONE) or has_section(npc, "sr_idle@wait_actor")
end

-- In the fight: alive or down (a teammate may still lift him). Without the engine's answer: alive.
local function fighting_life(id)
	local api = rawget(_G, "coop")
	if not (api and api.life_of) then return true end
	local ok, l = pcall(api.life_of, id)
	if not (ok and type(l) == "string") then return true end
	return l == "alive" or l == "wounded"
end

local function pit_fighter(zone)
	for _, o in ipairs(P.everyone()) do
		local ok, inside = pcall(zone.inside, zone, o:position())
		if ok and inside and fighting_life(id_of(o)) then return o end
	end
	return nil
end

local function pit_dead(npc)
	local zone = db.zone_by_name and db.zone_by_name[PIT_ZONE] or npc
	local now = time_global()
	local st = db.storage[id_of(npc)]
	local act = st and st.activation_time
	if pit_fresh or act ~= pit_act then pit_seen, pit_act, pit_fresh = now, act, false end -- a new entry into sr_idle@fight
	local o = pit_fighter(zone)
	if o then
		pit_seen = now
		if not pit then pit = { id = id_of(o) } end
		return false
	end
	return now - pit_seen >= PIT_GONE_MS
end

-- The monster fight's logics: bar_arena_sr and the one of bar_arena_spam.ltx (on another restrictor: found by its section).
local function pit_logics()
	local sr, spam = nil, nil
	for name, z in pairs(db.zone_by_name or {}) do
		if name == PIT_ZONE then sr = z elseif has_section(z, "sr_idle@notiming") then spam = z end
	end
	return sr, spam
end

local function pit_reset_tick()
	if not has_alife_info("bar_arena_actor_dead") then return end
	local sr, spam = pit_logics()
	local st = sr and db.storage[id_of(sr)]
	if not (st and st.active_section == "sr_idle@nil") then return end
	for _, m in ipairs(PIT_MONSTERS) do
		local id = get_story_object_id("bar_arena_" .. m)
		if id and alife_object(id) then alife_release_id(id) end
	end
	give_info("bar_old_arena_reset")
	for _, info in ipairs(PIT_INFOS) do disable_info(info) end
	xr_logic.switch_to_section(sr, st.ini, "sr_idle@idle")
	local sp = spam and db.storage[id_of(spam)]
	if sp and sp.ini then xr_logic.switch_to_section(spam, sp.ini, "sr_idle@introduce") end
	pit, pit_fresh = nil, true
	P.log(TAG, "monster fight: its fighter died, the arena is back at its start")
end

local function route_dead(cur, actor, npc, ...)
	if session() and authority() and is_pit_logic(npc) then return pit_dead(npc) end
	return cur(actor, npc, ...)
end

local function ensure_pit()
	local xc = coop_util.module("xr_conditions")
	local cur = xc and coop_mods_core.fn(xc, "actor_dead")
	if cur and not OURS[cur] then
		local w = function(...) return route_dead(cur, ...) end
		OURS[w] = true
		xc.actor_dead = w
		stats.rewrapped = stats.rewrapped + 1
	end
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Group entry: the players gather at Arnie (authority), the board and the key (every player's machine, coop_hud_arena)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- As at a transition: people walk up, and the one who decided to start holds the use key to go with those near. A held fight
-- starts only by its starter's key, with who stands within GATHER_RADIUS of Arnie at that moment: never by itself, and a
-- player who said nothing is not taken.
-- The fight starts: the gathering ends, `ids` (the starter first) fight. The boards go, the fighters lose their UI (stock
-- disable_ui of sr_idle@wait_N, which nobody got while the group gathered), and the trigger goes on (its 1 s timer is long over:
-- the cutscene at once).
local function begin(ids, why)
	if not fight then return end
	local told = fight.board
	fight.hold, fight.board, fight.passed = nil, nil, nil
	fight.ids, fight.id = ids, ids[1]
	fighters_of[fight.n] = ids
	for id in pairs(told or {}) do go(id, "gather", "off") end
	if told then
		for _, id in ipairs(ids) do go(id, "ui_off") end
	end
	P.log(TAG, "fight %d: %d fighter(s) go in (%s): %s", fight.n, #ids, tostring(why), table.concat(ids, ","))
end

local function nick_of(id)
	local peer = P.peer_of(id)
	local p = peer ~= nil and P.player(peer)
	return p and p.nick or "?"
end

-- The starter left the map (or the session) or is down: the key goes to the player on his feet nearest to Arnie within
-- GATHER_RADIUS; with nobody there it waits for him (or for the first one who comes). -> true: it went to another.
local function pass_key(near, dist)
	local id = fight.id
	-- his id held by an object that is no player (he left, X-Ray gave the id to another object) is no starter here
	local here = obj_of(id) ~= nil and P.is_player_id(id)
	if here and P.standing(id) then return false end
	local best, bd = nil, math.huge
	for _, v in ipairs(near) do
		if v ~= id and dist[v] < bd then best, bd = v, dist[v] end
	end
	if not best then return false end
	P.log(TAG, "fight %d: its starter %s is %s: %s (peer %s) can start it now", fight.n, tostring(id),
		here and "down" or "not on the map", tostring(best), tostring(P.peer_of(best)))
	fight.id, fight.passed = best, true
	fighters_of[fight.n] = { best }
	return true
end

-- The authority, every tick while the group gathers (and when a fight is taken): each player on the map is told his part when
-- it changes. `force`: the starter alone, now (the trigger went on by another road).
gather_tick = function(force)
	if not (fight and fight.hold) then return end
	if force then return begin({ fight.id }, "the trigger went on") end
	if not fight_running() then return fight_over() end
	-- The gathering is the Bar's, at Arnie. Off the Bar (a co-op group that walked to another map: its load brings the held fight
	-- back) or with Arnie not here it rests: the fight stays held, who was told hears "off", nobody else is told anything (no
	-- "<nick> waits for you at Arnie" on another map, no new tip and spot on Arnie after every level change).
	local man = manager()
	if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL or not man then
		if not fight.rests then
			fight.rests = true
			P.log(TAG, "fight %d: the group gathers at Arnie, %s: it waits, nobody is told", fight.n,
				level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL and "this is not the Bar" or "Arnie is not here")
		end
		for id in pairs(fight.board) do
			fight.board[id] = nil
			if P.peer_of(id) ~= nil then go(id, "gather", "off") end
		end
		return
	end
	fight.rests = nil
	local near, all, dist = gathered(fight.id)
	if pass_key(near, dist) then near, all, dist = gathered(fight.id) end
	local is_near, r, o = {}, {}, {}
	for _, id in ipairs(near) do
		is_near[id] = true
		r[#r + 1] = P.peer_of(id)
	end
	for _, id in ipairs(all) do
		if not is_near[id] then o[#o + 1] = P.peer_of(id) end
	end
	r, o = table.concat(r, ","), table.concat(o, ",")
	local by, sp = nick_of(fight.id), P.peer_of(fight.id)
	-- Arnie as the authority sees him: a player's machine may not have him online, or not know his story id
	local mp = man:position()
	local function dm(v) return mp and math.floor(v * 10 + 0.5) / 10 or nil end
	local here = {}
	for _, id in ipairs(all) do
		here[id] = true
		local mode
		if id == fight.id then mode = is_near[id] and "lead" or "lead_far" else mode = is_near[id] and "with" or "invite" end
		local said = table.concat({ mode, r, o, tostring(sp), fight.passed and "p" or "" }, "|")
		if fight.board[id] ~= said then
			fight.board[id] = said
			go(id, "gather", mode, { n = fight.n, w = by, s = sp, c = #near, t = #all, r = r, o = o, p = fight.passed and 1 or nil,
				m = man and id_of(man) or nil, ax = mp and dm(mp.x), ay = mp and dm(mp.y), az = mp and dm(mp.z) })
		end
	end
	for id in pairs(fight.board) do
		if not here[id] then -- off the map: his board goes
			fight.board[id] = nil
			if P.peer_of(id) ~= nil then go(id, "gather", "off") end
		end
	end
end

-- The authority: the key of the player whose character is `id`. Only the starter's, and only at Arnie: who stands within
-- GATHER_RADIUS of Arnie now goes in, the starter first.
local function start_ask(id)
	if not (fight and fight.hold) then return end
	local near = gathered(fight.id)
	local why = (id ~= fight.id and "he is not its starter") or (near[1] ~= id and "he is not at Arnie") or nil
	if why then
		stats.refused = stats.refused + 1
		P.log(TAG, "! fight %d: the key of character %s does nothing: %s (the starter is %s)", fight.n, tostring(id), why, tostring(fight.id))
		return
	end
	stats.starts = stats.starts + 1
	begin(near, "the starter held the use key at Arnie")
end

-- This player's key: to the authority.
local function ask_start()
	if not (session() and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) then return end
	if authority() then return start_ask(own_id()) end
	P.send("arena.start", {}, 0)
end

local function fmt(id, fallback, ...)
	local ok, s = pcall(string.format, coop_util.tr(id, fallback), ...)
	return ok and s or fallback
end

local function drop_invite()
	if invite_spot and level.map_remove_object_spot then pcall(level.map_remove_object_spot, invite_spot, SPOT_TYPE) end
	invite_spot = nil
end

-- What the authority says to this player while the group gathers: kept for coop_hud_arena (gather_view). An invitation gets one
-- tip and the map spot on Arnie a fight; a key passed to him one chat line.
PLAY.gather = function(a, t)
	t = t or {}
	-- the gathering is shown on the Bar alone: on another map whatever comes of it is "off"
	if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then a = "off" end
	local was = board
	if a ~= "invite" then drop_invite() end
	if not (a == "lead" or a == "lead_far" or a == "with" or a == "invite") then
		board = nil
		return
	end
	local n = tonumber(t.n)
	board = { a = a, n = n, w = type(t.w) == "string" and t.w or "?", s = tonumber(t.s), c = tonumber(t.c) or 0,
		t = tonumber(t.t) or 0, near = id_list(t.r), far = id_list(t.o), passed = t.p ~= nil, m = tonumber(t.m),
		ax = tonumber(t.ax), ay = tonumber(t.ay), az = tonumber(t.az) }
	local fresh = not (was and was.n == n)
	-- the tip is one a fight: walking up to Arnie ("with") and away again brings the spot back, not the tip
	board.tipped = (not fresh and was.tipped) or nil
	if a == "invite" then
		local man_id = get_story_object_id and get_story_object_id(MANAGER)
		if man_id and not invite_spot and level.map_add_object_spot then
			if pcall(level.map_add_object_spot, man_id, SPOT_TYPE, coop_util.tr("st_coop_arena_spot", "Arnie: the arena fight")) then invite_spot = man_id end
		end
	end
	if a == "invite" and not board.tipped then
		board.tipped = true
		local nm = coop_util.module("news_manager")
		local send = nm and coop_mods_core.fn(nm, "send_tip")
		local text = fmt("st_coop_arena_invite", "%s invites you to the arena: fight %s. Come to Arnie.", board.w, tostring(n or "?"))
		if send then pcall(send, db.actor, text, nil, "arena", 10000) end
	end
	if board.passed and (a == "lead" or a == "lead_far") and (fresh or not (was.a == "lead" or was.a == "lead_far")) then
		local chat = coop_util.module("coop_core_chat")
		local say = chat and coop_mods_core.fn(chat, "system")
		if say then pcall(say, fmt("st_coop_arena_passed", "You can start arena fight %s now: hold the use key at Arnie.", tostring(n or "?"))) end
	end
end

-- coop_hud_arena: what this player is told of the gathering at Arnie, nil: none. { a = "lead" | "lead_far" | "with" | "invite",
-- n = the fight, w / s = the starter's nick / peer, c / t = near Arnie / on the map, near / far = peers, passed, arnie = Arnie's
-- id here, pos = his position (nil: not here), dist = m from this player to him }
function gather_view()
	if not (board and session()) or level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then return nil end
	local v = { a = board.a, n = board.n, w = board.w, s = board.s, c = board.c, t = board.t, near = board.near, far = board.far,
		passed = board.passed }
	local man = manager()
	if man then
		v.arnie, v.pos = id_of(man), man:position()
	elseif board.ax and board.ay and board.az then
		v.arnie, v.pos = board.m and P.to_local(board.m) or nil, vector():set(board.ax, board.ay, board.az)
	end
	if v.pos and db.actor then v.dist = db.actor:position():distance_to(v.pos) end
	return v
end

-- coop_hud_arena: this player held the use key at Arnie.
function start_pressed()
	ask_start()
end

-- The group's start: this player's UI off, as the trigger's sr_idle@wait_N does in stock.
PLAY.ui_off = function()
	local xe = coop_util.module("xr_effects")
	local f = xe and coop_mods_core.fn(xe, "disable_ui")
	if f then f(db.actor, nil) end
end

-- This player's spot in the pit: the cutscene's point, the others sideways from it (1, -1, 2, -2 ... steps).
local function own_spot()
	if spot_k <= 0 or not db.actor then return end
	local pos = db.actor:position()
	local side = (spot_k % 2 == 1) and 1 or -1
	local step = math.ceil(spot_k / 2) * SPOT_STEP * side
	db.actor:set_actor_position(vector():set(pos.x + step, pos.y, pos.z))
end

-- The trigger's sr_idle@wait_N holds while the group gathers: its on_timer 1000 is not looked at.
-- Found waiting there for fight n with no record of it, or with one of neither fighters nor a gathering (an older save made
-- while the group gathered), the fight is taken and no key started it:
--   - no record, its 1 s timer (stock on_timer = 1000) not due yet: a fight taken now with nobody to ask the audience rule (a host
--     alone): as at the dialog (current: alone on the map at once, else the group gathers);
--   - no record, its timer due already: the record was lost (a new map server of the Bar: it writes nothing into the save, and the
--     trigger's logic comes back through the world server with its old activation time; a save with none). Who took it is not
--     known: never at once, the one picked starts it by his key at Arnie;
--   - the old record: its taker alone on the map at once, else the group gathers.
-- With nobody on the map the timer waits (else the trigger would take the taker, or one picked anew, alone, without a key).
local function patch_idle()
	local si = coop_util.module("sr_idle")
	local cls = si and si.action_idle
	local upd = cls and cls.update
	if type(upd) ~= "function" or OURS[upd] then return end
	local function adopt(n, obj)
		if fight and fight.n == n then
			local _, all = gathered(fight.id)
			if #all <= 1 and all[1] == fight.id then fight.ids = { fight.id } else fight.hold, fight.board = true, {} end
			fighters_of[n] = fight.ids or { fight.id }
			P.log(TAG, "fight %d: its trigger waits, a save before the group's key: taken by %s, %s", n, tostring(fight.id),
				fight.hold and "the group gathers" or "nobody else on the map: it starts")
			if fight.hold then gather_tick() end
		else
			local id = id_of(obj)
			local at = id and db.storage[id] and db.storage[id].activation_time
			local lost = type(at) == "number" and time_global() - at >= 1000
			current(nil, lost)
			if lost and fight and fight.n == n then P.log(TAG, "fight %d: its trigger waits with no record here: taken anew", n) end
		end
	end
	local w = function(self, ...)
		if fight and fight.hold then
			if session() and authority() and self and is_trigger(self.object) then return end
			return upd(self, ...)
		end
		local sec = self and self.st and self.st.section
		if type(sec) == "string" and sec:find("^sr_idle@wait_%d") and session() and authority() and is_trigger(self.object) then
			local n = fight_running()
			if n and sec == "sr_idle@wait_" .. n and not (fight and fight.n == n and fight.ids) then
				adopt(n, self.object)
				-- held: the group gathers, or nobody is on the map
				if not (fight and fight.n == n and fight.ids) then return end
			end
		end
		return upd(self, ...)
	end
	OURS[w] = true
	cls.update = w
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The rank gate after fights 3 and 6 (authority)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Stock: restrictor bar_arena_rank_checker gives bar_arena_rank_false (Arnie offers no next fight) with
-- {!bar_actor_rank_stalker ... +bar_arena_fight_3_done} and {!bar_actor_rank_veteran ... +bar_arena_fight_6_done};
-- xr_conditions.bar_actor_rank_stalker / _veteran read db.actor, the host's character (> 1499, > 2999). In a session they read
-- the player who takes the fight: the one who talks to Arnie now (coop.talk_holder), else the one nearest to him.
local RANKS = { bar_actor_rank_stalker = 1499, bar_actor_rank_veteran = 2999 }

local function rank_player()
	local man = manager()
	local api = rawget(_G, "coop")
	if man and api and type(api.talk_holder) == "function" then
		local ok, peer = pcall(api.talk_holder, id_of(man))
		local o = ok and type(peer) == "number" and P.object_of_peer(peer)
		if o then return o end
	end
	local mp = man and man:position()
	if not mp then return nil end
	local best, bd = nil, math.huge
	for _, o in ipairs(P.everyone()) do
		local d = o:position():distance_to_sqr(mp)
		if d < bd then best, bd = o, d end
	end
	return best
end

local function route_rank(cur, need, actor, npc, ...)
	if not (session() and authority()) then return cur(actor, npc, ...) end
	local o = rank_player()
	if not o or id_of(o) == own_id() and coop_mode.actor_is_player() then return cur(actor, npc, ...) end -- the host himself: stock
	local ok, r = pcall(o.character_rank, o)
	if not (ok and tonumber(r)) then return cur(actor, npc, ...) end
	return tonumber(r) > need
end

local function ensure_rank()
	local xc = coop_util.module("xr_conditions")
	if not xc then return end
	for name, need in pairs(RANKS) do
		local cur = coop_mods_core.fn(xc, name)
		if cur and not OURS[cur] then
			local w = function(...) return route_rank(cur, need, ...) end
			OURS[w] = true
			xc[name] = w
			stats.rewrapped = stats.rewrapped + 1
		end
	end
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Arnie's prizes (authority) and the reputation of a fight (every player's machine)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The prize of fight n (bar_arena_fight_n_reward, given by the trigger after a win) is collected in a dialog with Arnie on the
-- machine of whoever talks: stock pays the talker (dialogs.relocate_money_to_actor), counts his arena battle and takes off
-- bar_arena_fight and bar_arena_fight_begin. Here the talker's machine asks the authority (arena.prize), which runs the stock
-- call (a mod's version with it) with the money and the battle going to the fight's fighters; a fight that runs meanwhile
-- keeps its two infos (they spare its fighters' reputation, game_statistics.increment_reputation, on their own machines).
local PRIZES = { new = "new_arena_give_reward", old = "arena_give_reward" }
local prize_cur = {} -- kind -> the function our wrapper wraps (the stock call, a mod's version)

local function share_mode()
	local ok, v = pcall(function() return get_console():get_integer("coop_share_rewards") end)
	return ok and tonumber(v) or 0
end

-- { { id, amount }, ... }: n RU of a prize won by `fighters`, collected by `taker` (coop_share_rewards, coop_reward_group):
-- 0 to the one who collects it if he fought, else to the first fighter; 1 and 2 split among the fighters, the remainder to
-- that one; 3 to each in full.
local function prize_plan(n, fighters, taker)
	local main = fighters[1]
	for _, id in ipairs(fighters) do
		if id == taker then main = id end
	end
	local mode = share_mode()
	if #fighters <= 1 or mode == 0 then return { { main, n } } end
	local plan = {}
	if mode == 3 then
		for _, id in ipairs(fighters) do plan[#plan + 1] = { id, n } end
		return plan
	end
	local part = math.floor(n / #fighters)
	local rest = n - part * #fighters
	for _, id in ipairs(fighters) do
		local m = part + (id == main and rest or 0)
		if m > 0 then plan[#plan + 1] = { id, m } end
	end
	return plan
end

-- n RU for the player whose character is `id`: this machine's own player the stock way (`reloc`: the money line too), a client
-- through the host ledger (coop.money_grant) with his money line (coop_tasks_rewards.money_line).
local function pay(id, n, reloc, first, second)
	if not (n and n > 0) then return end
	if id == own_id() and coop_mode.actor_is_player() then return reloc(first, second, n) end
	local peer = P.peer_of(id)
	local api = rawget(_G, "coop")
	local grant = api and api.money_grant
	if peer == nil or type(grant) ~= "function" then
		P.log(TAG, "! a prize of %d RU for character %s: %s", n, tostring(id), peer == nil and "he is not in the session" or "no coop.money_grant")
		return
	end
	local ok, granted = pcall(grant, peer, math.floor(n))
	if not (ok and granted) then
		P.log(TAG, "! a prize of %d RU for peer %s refused: %s", n, tostring(peer), tostring(granted))
		return
	end
	local rewards = coop_util.module("coop_tasks_rewards")
	local line = rewards and coop_mods_core.fn(rewards, "money_line")
	if line then pcall(line, peer, math.floor(n)) end
end

-- The prize of the first waiting fight (stock picks it the same way), nil: none.
local function waiting_prize()
	for n = 1, FIGHTS do
		if has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_" .. n .. "_reward") then return n end
	end
	return nil
end

-- The authority: the stock call of the prize `kind`, collected by the player whose character is `taker`.
local function prize(kind, taker, first, second)
	local cur = prize_cur[kind]
	if not cur then return end
	local n = kind == "new" and waiting_prize() or nil
	local fighters = (kind == "new" and n and fighters_of[n]) or (kind == "old" and pit_won and { pit_won }) or nil
	if not (fighters and #fighters > 0) then fighters = { taker } end -- no record (a fight from before): stock, the talker
	local running = fight_running() ~= nil
	local had = { bar_arena_fight = has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight"), bar_arena_fight_begin = has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_begin") }
	local d, gs = coop_util.module("dialogs"), coop_util.module("game_statistics")
	local reloc = d and coop_mods_core.fn(d, "relocate_money_to_actor")
	local count = gs and coop_mods_core.fn(gs, "increment_statistic")
	local function money(f, s, m)
		for _, e in ipairs(prize_plan(tonumber(m) or 0, fighters, taker)) do pay(e[1], e[2], reloc, f, s) end
	end
	local function battle(name, ...)
		if name ~= "arena_battles" then return count(name, ...) end
		for _, id in ipairs(fighters) do
			if id == own_id() and coop_mode.actor_is_player() then count(name, ...) else go(id, "stat", name) end
		end
	end
	if reloc then d.relocate_money_to_actor = money end
	if count then gs.increment_statistic = battle end
	paying = true
	local ok, err = pcall(cur, first, second)
	paying = false
	if reloc and d.relocate_money_to_actor == money then d.relocate_money_to_actor = reloc end
	if count and gs.increment_statistic == battle then gs.increment_statistic = count end
	if running then
		for info, on in pairs(had) do
			if on and not has_alife_info(info) then give_info(info) end
		end
	end
	if kind == "new" and n then fighters_of[n] = nil elseif kind == "old" then pit_won = nil end
	stats.prizes = stats.prizes + 1
	P.log(TAG, "prize %s%s collected by %s: for %d fighter(s)%s", kind, n and (" of fight " .. n) or "", tostring(taker), #fighters,
		running and ", the running fight keeps bar_arena_fight" or "")
	if not ok then report("prize " .. kind, err) end
end

local function route_prize(kind, cur, first, second, ...)
	if paying then return cur(first, second, ...) end
	if not coop_mode.actor_is_player() then return end
	if not session() then return cur(first, second, ...) end
	if not authority() then
		stats.prize_asks = stats.prize_asks + 1
		P.send("arena.prize", { k = kind }, 0)
		return
	end
	return prize(kind, own_id(), first, second)
end

local function ensure_prizes()
	local tbl = coop_util.module("dialogs_bar")
	if not tbl then return end
	for _, kind in ipairs({ "new", "old" }) do
		local cur = coop_mods_core.fn(tbl, PRIZES[kind])
		if cur and not OURS[cur] then
			prize_cur[kind] = cur
			local w = function(...) return route_prize(kind, cur, ...) end
			OURS[w] = true
			tbl[PRIZES[kind]] = w
			stats.rewrapped = stats.rewrapped + 1
		end
	end
end

-- Every player's machine, with coop_debug on: his own reputation while a fight of the new arena runs or his gear waits for one
-- (one line each change, with its source), so a run tells where a change came from.
local rep_seen = nil

local function watching()
	return coop_debug_server.debug_on() and session() and db.actor ~= nil and (fight_running() ~= nil or mine == "fight")
end

local function reputation()
	local ok, v = pcall(db.actor.character_reputation, db.actor)
	return ok and tonumber(v) or nil
end

local function route_rep_line(cur, value, ...)
	if not (watching() and tonumber(value) and tonumber(value) ~= 0) then return cur(value, ...) end
	local before = reputation()
	local r = cur(value, ...)
	local after = reputation()
	stats.rep_lines = stats.rep_lines + 1
	P.log(TAG, "reputation in fight %s: game_statistics.increment_reputation(%s), bar_arena_fight %s: %s -> %s", tostring(fight_running()),
		tostring(value), has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight") and "on" or "off", tostring(before), tostring(after))
	rep_seen = after
	return r
end

local function rep_tick()
	if not watching() then
		rep_seen = nil
		return
	end
	local v = reputation()
	if v and rep_seen and v ~= rep_seen then
		stats.rep_lines = stats.rep_lines + 1
		P.log(TAG, "reputation in fight %s: %d -> %d (%+d), not game_statistics (the engine: an attack counted by the host, RelReputationDelta)",
			tostring(fight_running()), rep_seen, v, v - rep_seen)
	end
	rep_seen = v
end

local function ensure_rep_line()
	if not coop_debug_server.debug_on() then return end
	local gs = coop_util.module("game_statistics")
	local cur = gs and coop_mods_core.fn(gs, "increment_reputation")
	if cur and not OURS[cur] then
		local w = function(...) return route_rep_line(cur, ...) end
		OURS[w] = true
		gs.increment_reputation = w
		stats.rewrapped = stats.rewrapped + 1
	end
end

-- Our wrapper outermost: a mod that wrapped after us is wrapped again. In a session the outermost one routes; under it
-- (passing: this machine's own player) every layer, ours and the mods', runs on.
local function ensure_outer()
	for _, r in ipairs(ROUTES) do
		local tbl = coop_util.module(r[1])
		local cur = tbl and coop_mods_core.fn(tbl, r[2])
		if cur and not OURS[cur] then
			local route = r[3]
			local w = function(...)
				if passing or not session() then return cur(...) end
				return route(...)
			end
			OURS[w] = true
			tbl[r[2]] = w
			stats.rewrapped = stats.rewrapped + 1
		end
	end
	ensure_tips()
	ensure_pit()
	ensure_prizes()
	ensure_rep_line()
	ensure_rank()
end

-- The cutscene of the trigger plays on the fighter's machine alone.
local function patch_cutscene()
	local sc = coop_util.module("sr_cutscene")
	local cls = sc and sc.action_cutscene
	if not cls then return end
	local zone_enter, update, callback = cls.zone_enter, cls.update, cls.cutscene_callback
	if type(zone_enter) ~= "function" or OURS[zone_enter] or type(update) ~= "function" or type(callback) ~= "function" then return end
	local function enter(self, ...)
		self.coop_still, self.coop_tell, self.coop_said = nil, nil, nil
		if session() and is_trigger(self.object) then
			if authority() then current(self.object) end
			local me = fighting
			if authority() and fight then me = is_fighter(own_id()) and coop_mode.actor_is_player() end
			if not me then
				self.state = "run"
				self.coop_still = time_global()
				stats.still_cuts = stats.still_cuts + 1
				return
			end
			self.coop_tell = P.is_client() or nil
			local r = zone_enter(self, ...)
			own_spot()
			return r
		end
		return zone_enter(self, ...)
	end
	local function upd(self, ...)
		if self.coop_still then
			if authority() and (cut_done or time_global() - self.coop_still >= CUT_WAIT_MS) then
				if not self.coop_said then -- when the opponents are let go, and by what
					self.coop_said = true
					P.log(TAG, "fight %s: it begins %d ms after its cutscene began here (%s)", tostring(fight and fight.n),
						time_global() - self.coop_still, cut_done and "the fighters' cutscenes ended" or "no word of their end: waited")
				end
				self.st.signals = self.st.signals or {}
				self.st.signals["cameff_end"] = true
			end
			xr_logic.try_switch_to_another_section(self.object, self.st, db.actor)
			return
		end
		return update(self, ...)
	end
	local function cb(self, ...)
		local r = callback(self, ...)
		local sig = self.st and self.st.signals
		if sig and sig["cameff_end"] then
			if self.coop_tell then
				self.coop_tell = nil
				P.send("arena.cut", {}, 0)
			elseif session() and authority() and fight and coop_mode.actor_is_player() and is_fighter(own_id()) and is_trigger(self.object) then
				cut_seen(own_id()) -- the host player's own cutscene put him into the pit
			end
		end
		return r
	end
	OURS[enter] = true
	cls.zone_enter, cls.update, cls.cutscene_callback = enter, upd, cb
end

-- The arena zone counts what walks into it, a client's character too (a stalker on the host): a player is never purged. The
-- pit's binder (by its name: ZONE) is kept to tell who stands in the arena. The Bar binds arena_zone_binder to two zones
-- (all.spawn: bar_arena, the pit, then bar_old_arena, the old monster cage above it): taking the last one spawned would put a
-- fighter in the pit "outside the arena" (his own gear back in the fight, no way out after a win).
local function take_zone(binder)
	local o = binder and binder.object
	local ok, name = pcall(function() return o:name() end)
	name = ok and name or nil
	if name == ZONE then
		if arena_zone ~= binder then P.log(TAG, "the arena zone: %s", ZONE) end
		arena_zone, stats.zone = binder, ZONE
		return
	end
	if not binder.coop_skipped then
		binder.coop_skipped = true
		stats.other_zones = stats.other_zones + 1
		P.log(TAG, "an arena zone %s is not the pit (%s): it does not tell who stands in the arena", tostring(name), ZONE)
	end
end

local function patch_zone()
	local xz = coop_util.module("xr_zones")
	local cls = xz and xz.arena_zone_binder
	local f = cls and cls.purge_items
	if type(f) ~= "function" or OURS[f] then return end
	local ns = cls.net_spawn
	if type(ns) == "function" then
		local wn = function(self, ...)
			take_zone(self)
			return ns(self, ...)
		end
		OURS[wn] = true
		cls.net_spawn = wn
	end
	local w = function(self, ...)
		if not arena_zone then take_zone(self) end
		if session() and type(self.saved_obj) == "table" then
			for id in pairs(self.saved_obj) do
				if P.is_player_id(id) then
					self.saved_obj[id] = nil
					stats.players_kept = stats.players_kept + 1
				elseif P.is_player_id(item_place(id)) then
					self.saved_obj[id] = nil -- the zone can still remember an item picked up by a player
				end
			end
		end
		return f(self, ...)
	end
	OURS[w] = true
	cls.purge_items = w
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- A fighter's death in the arena (authority)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Stock: a death in the arena ends the game, nothing of the arena's leaves it. In a session he respawns at his camp, and
-- the give back there takes the kit by its ids alone (what he found since is his). That would leave him the kit's rifle
-- and an opponent's weapon. A weapon whose scope is put on is another object, a
-- magazine or an unloaded round too: no list of ids holds them. So what he holds is taken where he fell, the moment he is
-- dead: from the way in until then his character never left the arena, all of it is the arena's. Down is not dead (a
-- teammate may raise him). The stash the death's rule left at his body (named by coop_death_marker) holds the arena's
-- things as well: it is emptied, and the engine releases an empty death stash by itself (coop_death.cpp).
local STASH_WATCH_MS = 20000
local stashes = {} -- death stash id -> the time it was told

-- His record is the arena's custody until his character was seen alive outside the arena after it had been inside (a
-- rejoin somewhere else): then he walks free with what he has, and a later death is not the arena's.
local function fall_tick(now)
	if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then return end
	local box2 = get_story_object(BOX_OUT)
	for _, rec in pairs(ledger) do
		local id = rec.id
		local o = rec.kind == "fight" and not rec.fell and obj_of(id)
		if o and rec.character and character_key(id) == rec.character then
			local inside = in_arena(o)
			if fighting_life(id) then
				if inside then rec.inside, rec.loose = true, nil elseif rec.inside and inside == false then rec.loose = true end
			elseif box2 and (inside or (inside == nil and (rec.inside or rec.cut) and not rec.loose)) then
				local n = 0
				for _, item in ipairs(items_of(o)) do
					o:transfer_item(item, box2)
					n = n + 1
				end
				rec.fell = true
				stats.fell, stats.to_box2 = stats.fell + 1, stats.to_box2 + n
				P.log(TAG, "%s fell in the arena: %d thing(s) he held there go into %s", tostring(o:name()), n, BOX_OUT)
			end
		end
	end
	for sid, at in pairs(stashes) do
		local box = level.object_by_id(sid)
		if box and box2 then
			local list = {}
			local ok, err = pcall(function()
				box:iterate_inventory_box(function(_, item) list[#list + 1] = item end, box)
				for _, item in ipairs(list) do box:transfer_item(item, box2) end
			end)
			if not ok then report("the stash of a death in the arena", err) end
			if ok and #list > 0 then
				stats.to_box2 = stats.to_box2 + #list
				P.log(TAG, "the stash %s of a death in the arena: %d thing(s) go into %s", tostring(sid), #list, BOX_OUT)
			end
		end
		if now - at >= STASH_WATCH_MS then stashes[sid] = nil end
	end
end

-- coop_death_marker(player, stash, "drop" | "corpse"), fired by the engine on every machine: the stash of a fighter who
-- died in the arena.
local function on_death_marker(player, stash)
	if type(stash) ~= "number" or level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL or not authority() then return end
	local rec = record_of(player)
	local o = obj_of(player)
	local inside = o and in_arena(o)
	if rec and rec.kind == "fight" and (rec.fell or inside or (inside == nil and (rec.inside or rec.cut) and not rec.loose)) then
		stashes[stash] = time_global()
	end
end

local function forget_character(id)
	for key, rec in pairs(ledger) do
		if rec.id == id then clear_record(key) end
	end
	for i = #(world_copy or {}), 1, -1 do
		local rec = world_copy[i]
		if type(rec) == "table" and rec.id == id then table.remove(world_copy, i) end
	end
	remove_fighter(id)
end

-- A disconnected avatar goes offline. Its ALife entity is unregistered when the character is retired.
local function on_avatar_unregister(se)
	if authority() and se:section_name() == AVATAR_SECTION then forget_character(se.id) end
end

-- The host's new life reuses the actor, so there is no ALife unregister for it.
local function on_actor_retirement()
	if authority() and coop_mode.actor_is_player() then
		forget_character(own_id())
		play("none")
	end
end

-- Diagnostics: the opponents turned on the fighter only once he
-- shot. While a fight runs, every WATCH_MS each living opponent says in one line what it knows of the taker; at most
-- WATCH_LINES a fight. Reads only.
local WATCH_MS, WATCH_LINES = 3000, 60

local function watch_tick(now)
	if not (fight and fight.ids and fight.n) then return end
	local w = fight.watch or { at = 0, n = 0 }
	fight.watch = w
	if now < w.at or w.n >= WATCH_LINES then return end
	w.at = now + WATCH_MS
	local who = obj_of(fight.id)
	if not who then return end
	local function v(f)
		local ok, r = pcall(f)
		return ok and tostring(r) or "?"
	end
	for k = 0, 6 do
		local sid = "bar_arena_stalker_" .. fight.n .. (k > 0 and ("_" .. k) or "")
		local npc = get_story_object(sid)
		if npc and w.n < WATCH_LINES and v(function() return npc:alive() end) == "true" then
			w.n = w.n + 1
			local st = db.storage[id_of(npc)]
			-- Log the light value used by visibility checks. The engine estimates it when the character has no renderer.
			P.log(TAG, "watch %s: logic %s, sees him %s (his light here %s), knew of him %s ms ago, %s m away, best enemy %s, relation %s, fight begun %s",
				sid, tostring(st and st.active_section), v(function() return npc:see(who) end),
				v(function() return string.format("%.3f", who:get_luminocity()) end),
				v(function() return time_global() - npc:memory_time(who) end),
				v(function() return math.floor(npc:position():distance_to(who:position())) end),
				v(function()
					local e = npc:best_enemy()
					return e and e:name() or "none"
				end), v(function() return npc:relation(who) end), tostring(has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_begin")))
		end
	end
end

-- The commentator plays bar_arena_fight_N_end when bar_arena_fight_N_done is set. Its sound_end calls route_out through
-- bar_arena_teleport_2 and clears bar_arena_fight_N. The modpack's variant also clears totaliz_begin_over_dialog.
-- If the sound callback does not arrive, the Bar authority waits for the line's timeout and runs route_out once for living
-- and downed fighters. Dead fighters' gear waits for their respawn. A record restored from saved
-- or carried state starts its wait when the authority sees the win because the line starts again on load.
-- A global: the file is at the limit of its locals (docs/MODES.md L7).
-- The wait uses the voice line durations in characters_voice\scenario\bar\arena_sound. The
-- end line bar_fight_N_finish (5.8, 7.7, 5.7, 5.8, 5.6, 9.5, 12.5, 12.9 s) waits for the fight's opening line bar_fight_N_ready
-- (15.3, 12.0, 13.1, 5.9, 13.0, 8.2, 25.4, 32.1 s), which starts at the dialog: at most ready - 13 s of it is left when the fight
-- starts (the trigger's 1 s, its cutscene camera_effects\arena.anm 360 frames at 30 fps: 12 s) and the win comes at once; the
-- theme's pause between two lines (idle = 1,1) 1 s; 3 s for the ticks.
function late_way_out(now)
	local n = fight and fight.ids and fight.n
	if type(n) ~= "number" or not has_alife_info("bar_arena_fight_" .. n .. "_done") then return end
	if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL then
		fight.won = nil -- the pit is the Bar's: the wait counts on the Bar
		return
	end
	fight.won = fight.won or now
	local wait = ({ 13, 12, 10, 10, 10, 14, 29, 37 })[n] or 37
	if now - fight.won < wait * 1000 then return end
	local alive = {}
	for _, id in ipairs(fight.ids) do
		if fighting_life(id) then
			alive[#alive + 1] = id
		else
			P.log(TAG, "fight %d: character %s is dead: his gear waits for his respawn", n, tostring(id))
		end
	end
	P.log(TAG, "fight %d: the commentator's end never came: the way out after %d s (%d fighter(s))", n, wait, #alive)
	fight.ids = alive
	route_out()
	for _, info in ipairs({ "bar_arena_fight_" .. n, "totaliz_begin_over_dialog" }) do
		if has_alife_info(info) and type(disable_info) == "function" then disable_info(info) end
	end
end

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Events, saves, ticks
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
local function avatar_of(from)
	local id = P.avatar_of_peer(from)
	return id ~= nil and obj_of(id) and id or nil
end

local function kit_ids(csv)
	if type(csv) ~= "string" or #csv > MAX_KIT_IDS * 6 - 1 then return nil end
	local ids = {}
	for token in (csv .. ","):gmatch("([^,]*),") do
		if #ids == MAX_KIT_IDS or #token > 5 or not token:match("^%d+$") then return nil end
		local id = tonumber(token)
		if id < 1 or id > 65534 then return nil end
		ids[#ids + 1] = id
	end
	return ids
end

local function register_events()
	P.on("arena.go", function(t)
		if type(t.f) == "string" then play(t.f, t.a, t) end
	end, "client", TAG)
	P.on("arena.bet", function(_, from)
		local id = avatar_of(from)
		if id then bet_of(id, obj_of(id)) end
	end, "host", TAG)
	P.on("arena.kit", function(t, from)
		local id = P.avatar_of_peer(from)
		local made = id and kit_ids(t.i)
		local valid = made ~= nil
		if not coop_trust.pass("arena.kit", valid, "invalid arena kit from peer %s", tostring(from)) or not valid then return end
		add_kit(id, made)
	end, "host", TAG)
	P.on("arena.out", function(_, from)
		local id = P.avatar_of_peer(from)
		if id ~= nil then out_of(id) end
	end, "host", TAG)
	P.on("arena.cut", function(_, from)
		local id = P.avatar_of_peer(from)
		if not (fight and is_fighter(id)) then return end
		cut_seen(id)
		fight.cuts = fight.cuts or {}
		fight.cuts[id] = true
		for _, f in ipairs(fighters()) do
			if not fight.cuts[f] and not (f == own_id() and coop_mode.actor_is_player()) then return end
		end
		cut_done = true
	end, "host", TAG)
	P.on("arena.start", function(_, from)
		local id = P.avatar_of_peer(from)
		if id ~= nil then start_ask(id) end
	end, "host", TAG)
	P.on("arena.prize", function(t, from)
		local id = avatar_of(from)
		if id and PRIZES[t.k] then prize(t.k, id, db.actor, manager()) end
	end, "host", TAG)
end

local function ledger_list()
	local list = {}
	for _, rec in pairs(ledger) do
		list[#list + 1] = { id = rec.id, character = rec.character, kind = rec.kind, items = rec.items, kit = rec.kit,
			inside = rec.inside, loose = rec.loose, fell = rec.fell, cut = rec.cut, orphan = rec.orphan }
	end
	table.sort(list, function(a, b) return row_key(a) < row_key(b) end)
	return list
end

local function numbers(t)
	local out = {}
	if type(t) == "table" then
		for _, v in ipairs(t) do
			if type(v) == "number" then out[#out + 1] = v end
		end
	end
	return out
end

-- Records from a save or from another process; `only_new`: what is here already stays.
local function take_list(list, only_new)
	for _, r in ipairs(type(list) == "table" and list or {}) do
		local key = row_key(r)
		if key and not (only_new and (ledger[key] or cleared[key])) then
			ledger[key] = { id = r.id, character = r.character, kind = r.kind == "bet" and "bet" or "fight",
				items = numbers(r.items), kit = numbers(r.kit), at = time_global(),
				inside = r.inside == true or nil, loose = r.loose == true or nil, fell = r.fell == true or nil,
				cut = r.cut == true or nil, orphan = r.orphan == true or nil }
			if not r.character then legacy_due = true end
		end
	end
end

local function save_state(m_data)
	m_data.coop_arena_gear = (mine == "fight" and true) or mine or nil
	if P.is_client() then return end
	local prizes = {}
	for n, ids in pairs(fighters_of) do prizes[#prizes + 1] = { n = n, ids = ids } end
	local keep = next(ledger) or fight or pit or (world_copy and #world_copy > 0) or #prizes > 0 or pit_won
	local fsave = fight and { id = fight.id, n = fight.n, ids = fight.ids, hold = fight.hold or nil } or nil
	m_data.coop_arena = keep and { ledger = ledger_list(), fight = fsave, split = world_copy, pit = pit, prizes = prizes,
		pit_won = pit_won } or nil
end

local function load_state(m_data)
	local g = m_data.coop_arena_gear
	mine = (g == true and "fight") or (g == "bet" and "bet") or false
	local a = m_data.coop_arena
	ledger, fight, cut_done, world_copy, pit, fighters_of, pit_won = {}, nil, false, nil, nil, {}, nil
	cleared, got_down = {}, false
	pit_fresh = true
	-- the ledger is the world's: a client loads the host's world, it is not his
	if type(a) ~= "table" or P.is_client() then return end
	take_list(a.ledger)
	if type(a.fight) == "table" and type(a.fight.id) == "number" then
		fight = { id = a.fight.id, n = a.fight.n }
		local ids = numbers(a.fight.ids)
		-- the group still gathers: it waits for its starter's key, as before the save. An older save keeps neither for a
		-- gathering, nor for its one fighter: the trigger tells which (still in sr_idle@wait_N: patch_idle)
		if #ids > 0 then
			fight.ids = ids
		elseif a.fight.hold == true then
			fight.hold, fight.board = true, {}
		end
	end
	if type(a.split) == "table" then world_copy = a.split end
	if type(a.pit) == "table" and type(a.pit.id) == "number" then pit = { id = a.pit.id } end
	for _, r in ipairs(type(a.prizes) == "table" and a.prizes or {}) do
		if type(r) == "table" and type(r.n) == "number" then fighters_of[r.n] = numbers(r.ids) end
	end
	if type(a.pit_won) == "number" then pit_won = a.pit_won end
end

-- Split levels: a map server leads the Bar, writes nothing into the save and stops when its level is empty. Its ledger goes up to
-- the world server (kept in its save) and comes down to the next map server of the Bar, which takes the records it has none of.
local function share_ledger()
	coop_mode.share_up("arena_ledger", function()
		if level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL or not (got_down or next(ledger) or next(cleared)) then return nil end
		local removed = {}
		for key in pairs(cleared) do removed[#removed + 1] = key end
		table.sort(removed)
		return { list = ledger_list(), based = got_down, removed = removed }
	end, function(t)
		if type(t) ~= "table" or type(t.list) ~= "table" then return end
		-- Before the first echo, merge the Bar's changes with the rows it has not seen yet.
		local by, list = {}, {}
		if not t.based then
			for _, r in ipairs(world_copy or {}) do
				local key = row_key(r)
				if key then by[key] = r end
			end
		end
		for _, key in ipairs(type(t.removed) == "table" and t.removed or {}) do
			if type(key) == "string" then by[key] = nil end
		end
		for _, r in ipairs(t.list) do
			local key = row_key(r)
			local se = key and alife_object(r.id)
			if se and se:section_name() == AVATAR_SECTION then
				local owner = avatar_key(se)
				if not r.character or not owner or key == tostring(r.id) .. ":" .. owner then by[key] = r end
			end
		end
		for _, r in pairs(by) do list[#list + 1] = r end
		table.sort(list, function(a, b) return row_key(a) < row_key(b) end)
		world_copy = list
	end)
	coop_mode.share_down("arena_ledger", function()
		return world_copy and { list = world_copy } or nil
	end, function(t)
		if got_down or level.name() ~= ARENA_LEVEL or type(t) ~= "table" then return end
		got_down = true
		take_list(t.list, true)
		cleared = {}
	end)
end

local next_tick = 0
local death_cb = false

local function actor_on_update()
	if waiting_in then wait_tick() end
	local now = time_global()
	if now < next_tick then return end
	next_tick = now + TICK_MS
	if not death_cb then
		death_cb = true
		-- here, after every on_game_start: coop_death adds the callback in its own on_game_start
		RegisterScriptCallback("coop_death_marker", on_death_marker)
		-- coop_menu_char declares this engine callback in its on_game_start.
		RegisterScriptCallback("coop_host_new_character", on_actor_retirement)
	end
	ensure_outer()
	rep_tick()
	if fighting and not fight_running() then fighting = false end
	if session() and authority() then
		if fight and fight.hold then
			local okg, errg = pcall(gather_tick)
			if not okg then report("gather", errg) end
		end
		local okl, errl = pcall(legacy_tick)
		if not okl then report("an older save's ledger", errl) end
		-- before the heal: a fighter who is dead is no "player standing here with nothing running"
		local okf, errf = pcall(fall_tick, now)
		if not okf then report("a fighter's fall", errf) end
		okf, errf = pcall(watch_tick, now)
		if not okf then report("watch", errf) end
		-- after the fall (a fighter dead in the pit), before the heal (route_out changes the ledger)
		okf, errf = pcall(late_way_out, now)
		if not okf then report("the way out after a win", errf) end
		local ok, err = pcall(heal_tick, now)
		if not ok then report("heal", err) end
		ok, err = pcall(pit_reset_tick)
		if not ok then report("monster fight reset", err) end
	end
end

-- A rejoin, or a walk back to the Bar: the fight ended without him, nothing else gives his gear back.
local function actor_on_first_update()
	ensure_outer()
	if not fight_running() then ask_out() end
end

function print_status()
	local n = 0
	for _ in pairs(ledger) do n = n + 1 end
	return string.format("ledger %d, fight %s%s, zone %s (other arena zones %d), keys at Arnie %d (refused %d), stowed %d, returned %d, to box 2 %d (fighters fell %d), missing %d, players kept %d, still cutscenes %d, rewrapped %d, lines to a fighter %d, prizes %d (asked %d), reputation lines %d, errors %d",
		n, fight and tostring(fight.n) or "-", fight and fight.hold and " (gathers)" or "", stats.zone, stats.other_zones, stats.starts,
		stats.refused, stats.stowed, stats.returned, stats.to_box2, stats.fell, stats.missing, stats.players_kept,
		stats.still_cuts, stats.rewrapped, stats.tips, stats.prizes, stats.prize_asks, stats.rep_lines, stats.errors)
end

-- Tests and diagnostics.
function _state()
	return { ledger = ledger, fight = fight, mine = mine, fighting = fighting, stats = stats, cut_done = cut_done, world_copy = world_copy,
		got_down = got_down, pit = pit, prizes = fighters_of, pit_won = pit_won }
end

function on_game_start()
	P = coop_npc_players
	if not rawget(_G, "coop") then return end -- exe without co-op: stock
	local em = coop_util.module("coop_economy_mdata")
	if em and em.register_player_key then
		em.register_player_key("coop_arena_gear", function() return (mine == "fight" and true) or mine or nil, true end)
	end
	for _, s in ipairs({ { "routes", ensure_outer }, { "cutscene", patch_cutscene }, { "zone", patch_zone }, { "idle", patch_idle } }) do
		local ok, err = pcall(s[2])
		if not ok then report("install " .. s[1], err) end
	end
	local logic = coop_util.module("coop_npc_logic")
	if logic and logic.add_audience_rule then logic.add_audience_rule(audience_rule) end
	local ok, err = pcall(share_ledger)
	if not ok then report("share", err) end
	register_events()
	RegisterScriptCallback("actor_on_update", actor_on_update)
	RegisterScriptCallback("actor_on_first_update", actor_on_first_update)
	RegisterScriptCallback("coop_respawned", ask_out)
	RegisterScriptCallback("server_entity_on_unregister", on_avatar_unregister)
	RegisterScriptCallback("save_state", save_state)
	RegisterScriptCallback("load_state", load_state)
	coop_mods_core.status_line(TAG, print_status)
end
